From fc7699bf21e2b5d5b48cab6a9dcd1f2feeed60c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ssch71 <s01093450498@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Restore DeX navigation bar support

flip-qssi SystemUI is built with NAVBAR_DESKTOP folded to false, so R8
stripped the desktop navbar/taskbar paths and left a null-throw stub in
NavigationBarControllerImpl$2.onDisplayAddSystemDecorations, crashing
SystemUI as soon as a DeX display is added. Port the desktop paths back
from the S23 (qssi) build.
